# Code owners — require review on the integrity-critical surfaces.
#
# HIVE can modify its own source (`chb implement` opens PRs). CODEOWNERS
# + branch protection ensure a human owns these paths even when the agent
# touches them: a self-PR can never self-merge changes to the gate, the
# runner/egress path, the proofs, CI, or the release/security config.
#
# Enforcement is GitHub-side: enable "Require review from Code Owners" in
# branch protection for `main` for this file to have teeth.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @the-chronomancer

# The integrity gate + MSS truth-label core.
/internal/mss/          @the-chronomancer

# Provider resolution + egress allowlist + agent runner (blast radius).
/internal/runner/       @the-chronomancer

# The Lean 4 proof tree behind the gate's guarantees.
/lean4/                 @the-chronomancer

# Build, release, CI, and security policy.
/.github/               @the-chronomancer
/.goreleaser.yaml       @the-chronomancer
/Dockerfile             @the-chronomancer
/SECURITY.md            @the-chronomancer
